            ['start_time'=>545.64,'end_time'=>548.1,'target_text'=>'Now, I have some questions to ask you guys.','source_text'=>'Kini, saya ada beberapa soalan untuk diajukan kepada anda semua.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>548.2,'end_time'=>552.3,'target_text'=>'I want you to try to answer these questions with everything you\'ve learned so far.','source_text'=>'Saya mahu anda cuba menjawab soalan ini dengan semua yang telah anda pelajari setakat ini.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>552.4,'end_time'=>553.26,'target_text'=>'Okay?','source_text'=>'Boleh?','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>553.36,'end_time'=>554.74,'target_text'=>'First question.','source_text'=>'Soalan pertama.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>554.84,'end_time'=>555.94,'target_text'=>'How are you?','source_text'=>'Apa khabar?','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>556.04,'end_time'=>556.66,'target_text'=>'How are you?','source_text'=>'How are you?','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>556.76,'end_time'=>558.06,'target_text'=>'Just a normal question.','source_text'=>'Hanya soalan biasa.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>558.16,'end_time'=>560.26,'target_text'=>'This is a very common question in English.','source_text'=>'Ini soalan yang sangat biasa dalam Bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>560.36,'end_time'=>561.98,'target_text'=>'How are you?','source_text'=>'Apa khabar?','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>562.08,'end_time'=>563.94,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m doing great.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat baik.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>564.04,'end_time'=>564.66,'target_text'=>'>> Perfect.','source_text'=>'Sempurna.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>564.76,'end_time'=>566.94,'target_text'=>'How are you feeling?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana perasaan anda?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>567.04,'end_time'=>569.18,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m feeling hot right now.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa panas sekarang.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>569.28,'end_time'=>570.98,'target_text'=>'>> Are you okay?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda okay?','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>571.08,'end_time'=>572.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, I think I\'m okay.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya rasa saya okay.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>572.96,'end_time'=>575.74,'target_text'=>'>> Why are you so happy?','source_text'=>'Kenapa anda sangat gembira?','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>575.84,'end_time'=>578.12,'target_text'=>'>> Because I\'m traveling.','source_text'=>'Kerana saya sedang mengembara.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>578.44,'end_time'=>579.9,'target_text'=>'>> Because you\'re in Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Kerana anda berada di Indonesia.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>580,'end_time'=>580.28,'target_text'=>'Hey, yo.','source_text'=>'Hey, yo.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>580.28,'end_time'=>581.78,'target_text'=>'Let me know if you\'re in Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya jika anda berada di Indonesia.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>581.88,'end_time'=>585.06,'target_text'=>'Shout out to everyone in Indonesia and from Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Salam hormat kepada semua di Indonesia dan dari Indonesia.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>585.16,'end_time'=>587.24,'target_text'=>'What\'s wrong?','source_text'=>'Apa yang tak kena?','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>587.4,'end_time'=>588.86,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m sweating too much.','source_text'=>'Saya berpeluh terlalu banyak.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>588.96,'end_time'=>589.62,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>589.72,'end_time'=>591.58,'target_text'=>'Are you nervous?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda gugup?','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>591.68,'end_time'=>592.86,'target_text'=>'>> Not really.','source_text'=>'Tidak juga.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>592.96,'end_time'=>595.58,'target_text'=>'>> When do you get nervous?','source_text'=>'Bila masanya anda menjadi gugup?','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>595.68,'end_time'=>598.78,'target_text'=>'>> When I\'m almost late for my flight at the airport.','source_text'=>'Apabila saya hampir lewat untuk menaiki penerbangan saya di lapangan terbang.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>598.88,'end_time'=>599.58,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>599.68,'end_time'=>600.94,'target_text'=>'Very good one.','source_text'=>'Jawapan yang sangat bagus.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>601.04,'end_time'=>603.6,'target_text'=>'Do you feel stressed?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda merasa tertekan?','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>603.76,'end_time'=>605.74,'target_text'=>'>> Sometimes, yes.','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang, ya.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>605.84,'end_time'=>608.46,'target_text'=>'>> Do you feel stressed right now?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda merasa tertekan sekarang?','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>608.56,'end_time'=>609.1,'target_text'=>'>> Right now?','source_text'=>'Sekarang?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>609.2,'end_time'=>610.34,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Tidak.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>610.44,'end_time'=>613.64,'target_text'=>'>> What is your favorite emotion?','source_text'=>'Apakah emosi kegemaran anda?','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>614.16,'end_time'=>615.9,'target_text'=>'>> Happy.','source_text'=>'Gembira.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>616,'end_time'=>619.06,'target_text'=>'>> Don\'t just watch this lesson and forget it.','source_text'=>'Jangan sekadar menonton pelajaran ini dan kemudian melupakannya.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>619.16,'end_time'=>626.38,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this video on my website and practice everything from the lesson more deeply.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ini di laman web saya dan latih segala-galanya daripada pelajaran ini dengan lebih mendalam.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>626.48,'end_time'=>636.02,'target_text'=>'Inside, you\'ll review the grammar, vocabulary, tenses, sentence patterns, comprehension questions, and real English from this','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, anda akan menyemak tatabahasa, kosa kata, kala, struktur ayat, soalan pemahaman, dan Bahasa Inggeris yang sebenar daripada','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>636.12,'end_time'=>640.5,'target_text'=>'video with clear explanations and exercises.','source_text'=>'video ini berserta dengan penjelasan dan latihan yang jelas.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>640.6,'end_time'=>645.86,'target_text'=>'Watching helps you understand, but practicing helps you remember.','source_text'=>'Menonton membantu anda memahami, tetapi berlatih membantu anda mengingat.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>645.96,'end_time'=>651.1,'target_text'=>'And when you buy five or more workbooks, you automatically get 30% off at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan apabila anda membeli lima atau lebih buku latihan, anda secara automatik mendapat diskaun 30% semasa pembayaran.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>651.2,'end_time'=>654.9,'target_text'=>'The link is in the description or at vulkanenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Pautannya ada di bahagian penerangan atau di volkaenglish.com.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>655,'end_time'=>659.74,'target_text'=>'Okay, now let\'s go over some common mistakes people make when talking about emotions.','source_text'=>'Okay, sekarang mari kita lihat beberapa kesilapan lazim yang dilakukan orang semasa bercakap tentang emosi.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>659.84,'end_time'=>662.5,'target_text'=>'The first one, I am feel happy.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama, \'I am feel happy\'.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>662.6,'end_time'=>664.1,'target_text'=>'I am feel happy.','source_text'=>'Saya \'am feel happy\'.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>664.2,'end_time'=>665.34,'target_text'=>'This is incorrect.','source_text'=>'Ini salah.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>665.44,'end_time'=>666.14,'target_text'=>'Incorrect.','source_text'=>'Salah.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>666.24,'end_time'=>671.34,'target_text'=>'The correct way to say this is I feel happy or I am happy.','source_text'=>'Cara betul untuk menyebutnya adalah \'I feel happy\' atau \'I am happy\'.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>671.44,'end_time'=>672.06,'target_text'=>'Either one.','source_text'=>'Salah satu daripadanya.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>672.16,'end_time'=>674.98,'target_text'=>'The second one, I have nervous.','source_text'=>'Yang kedua, \'I have nervous\'.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>675.08,'end_time'=>676.94,'target_text'=>'I have nervous.','source_text'=>'Saya \'have nervous\'.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>677.04,'end_time'=>681.46,'target_text'=>'The correct way to say it is I\'m nervous or I am nervous.','source_text'=>'Cara betul menyebutnya adalah \'I\'m nervous\' atau \'I am nervous\'.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>681.56,'end_time'=>684.58,'target_text'=>'Third mistake, I\'m very stress.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan ketiga, \'I\'m very stress\'.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>684.68,'end_time'=>686.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m very stress.','source_text'=>'Saya \'very stress\'.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>686.28,'end_time'=>686.98,'target_text'=>'That\'s incorrect.','source_text'=>'Itu tidak betul.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>687.08,'end_time'=>690.54,'target_text'=>'The correct way to say that is I\'m very stressed.','source_text'=>'Cara betul menyebutnya adalah \'I\'m very stressed\'.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>690.64,'end_time'=>692.98,'target_text'=>'Stressed, not stress.','source_text'=>'Stressed, bukannya stress.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>693.08,'end_time'=>694.02,'target_text'=>'Stressed.','source_text'=>'Stressed.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>694.12,'end_time'=>697.5,'target_text'=>'The fourth mistake is I am exciting.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan keempat ialah \'I am exciting\'.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>697.6,'end_time'=>698.86,'target_text'=>'I am exciting.','source_text'=>'Saya \'am exciting\'.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>698.96,'end_time'=>702.1,'target_text'=>'The correct version is I am excited.','source_text'=>'Versi yang betul adalah \'I am excited\'.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>702.2,'end_time'=>704.58,'target_text'=>'Excited, not exciting.','source_text'=>'Excited, bukannya exciting.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>704.68,'end_time'=>708.58,'target_text'=>'The final most common mistake is he feel sad.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan lazim terakhir ialah \'he feel sad\'.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>708.68,'end_time'=>709.94,'target_text'=>'He feel sad.','source_text'=>'Dia \'feel sad\'.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>710.04,'end_time'=>711.82,'target_text'=>'That sounds like a caveman speaking.','source_text'=>'Itu terdengar seperti orang zaman purba bercakap.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>711.92,'end_time'=>714.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s he [music] feels sad.','source_text'=>'Ia sepatutnya \'he feels sad\'.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>714.6,'end_time'=>716.26,'target_text'=>'He feels sad.','source_text'=>'Dia \'feels sad\'.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>716.36,'end_time'=>719.66,'target_text'=>'Now we are going to have a shadowing conversation.','source_text'=>'Kini kita akan melakukan latihan perbualan bayangan.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>719.76,'end_time'=>724.82,'target_text'=>'I will read the blue, you read the yellow caption below.','source_text'=>'Saya akan membaca bahagian biru, anda membaca teks kuning di bawah.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>724.92,'end_time'=>727,'target_text'=>'Are you ready?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda bersedia?','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>727.16,'end_time'=>730.36,'target_text'=>'Hey, how are you feeling today?','source_text'=>'Hey, bagaimana perasaan anda hari ini?','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>731.76,'end_time'=>733.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, you look a little tired.','source_text'=>'Ya, anda kelihatan sedikit penat.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>733.6,'end_time'=>736.16,'target_text'=>'Did you sleep late?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda tidur lewat?','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>738.72,'end_time'=>739.54,'target_text'=>'That makes sense.','source_text'=>'Itu masuk akal.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>739.64,'end_time'=>744.24,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of tired, too, but I\'m also really happy today.','source_text'=>'Saya juga agak penat, tetapi saya juga sangat gembira hari ini.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>745.76,'end_time'=>751.56,'target_text'=>'Because the weather is beautiful and this kind of morning makes me feel relaxed.','source_text'=>'Kerana cuacanya indah dan pagi seperti ini membuatkan saya berasa tenang.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>753.6,'end_time'=>754.3,'target_text'=>'Same.','source_text'=>'Sama juga.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>754.4,'end_time'=>758.36,'target_text'=>'Yesterday I felt so stressed, though.','source_text'=>'Yesterday I felt so stressed, though.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>759.64,'end_time'=>764.04,'target_text'=>'Because I had too many things to do and I just felt overwhelmed.','source_text'=>'Kerana saya ada terlalu banyak benda untuk dilakukan dan saya rasa sangat terbeban.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>766,'end_time'=>766.86,'target_text'=>'Exactly.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>766.96,'end_time'=>771.08,'target_text'=>'But right now I feel much calmer.','source_text'=>'Tetapi sekarang saya berasa jauh lebih tenang.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>773.8,'end_time'=>775.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s a great feeling.','source_text'=>'Itu satu perasaan yang sangat hebat.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>775.56,'end_time'=>779.86,'target_text'=>'Now let\'s move on to the second dialogue talking before something important.','source_text'=>'Kini mari kita beralih ke dialog kedua bercakap sebelum perkara penting.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>779.96,'end_time'=>780.94,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get into it.','source_text'=>'Mari kita mulakan.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>781.04,'end_time'=>782.1,'target_text'=>'You look serious.','source_text'=>'Anda kelihatan serius.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>782.2,'end_time'=>784.4,'target_text'=>'How are you feeling?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana perasaan anda?','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>786.56,'end_time'=>789.08,'target_text'=>'Why are you nervous?','source_text'=>'Kenapa anda gugup?','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>791.96,'end_time'=>793.3,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s normal.','source_text'=>'Ya, itu biasa.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>793.4,'end_time'=>798.96,'target_text'=>'Big moments can make you feel excited and worried at the same time.','source_text'=>'Detik-detik penting boleh membuatkan anda berasa teruja dan bimbang pada masa yang sama.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>799.36,'end_time'=>803,'target_text'=>'That can definitely make you feel stressed.','source_text'=>'Itu pasti boleh membuatkan anda berasa tertekan.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>803.92,'end_time'=>806.8,'target_text'=>'So what helps you feel better?','source_text'=>'Jadi apa yang membantu anda berasa lebih baik?','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>808.36,'end_time'=>809.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s good.','source_text'=>'Itu bagus.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>809.16,'end_time'=>812.44,'target_text'=>'Do you feel hopeful, too?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda merasa penuh harapan juga?','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>814.48,'end_time'=>816.84,'target_text'=>'That\'s a good combination.','source_text'=>'Itu gabungan yang baik.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>818.44,'end_time'=>819.54,'target_text'=>'You should feel proud.','source_text'=>'Anda patut berasa bangga.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>819.64,'end_time'=>822.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s a strong mindset.','source_text'=>'Itu minda yang sangat kuat.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>822.28,'end_time'=>824.34,'target_text'=>'Hopefully you guys enjoyed that shadowing dialogue.','source_text'=>'Diharapkan anda semua menikmati dialog bayangan tersebut.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>824.44,'end_time'=>831.02,'target_text'=>'If you liked it and you want more, let me know in the comments and I will include them in all my videos going into the future.','source_text'=>'Jika anda menyukainya dan mahukan lagi, beritahu saya di ruangan komen dan saya akan memasukkannya dalam semua video saya pada masa hadapan.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>831.12,'end_time'=>832.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, what are you working on?','source_text'=>'Yo, apa yang kau sedang usahakan?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>832.72,'end_time'=>834.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I\'m working on my channel right now.','source_text'=>'Yo, aku tengah usahakan saluran aku sekarang.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>834.64,'end_time'=>835.34,'target_text'=>'Okay, I just started.','source_text'=>'Okay, aku baru sahaja bermula.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>835.44,'end_time'=>837.62,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to be posting once a week if you guys want to check it out.','source_text'=>'Aku akan pos seminggu sekali jika anda semua mahu melihatnya.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>837.72,'end_time'=>842.02,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories on my second channel, Volka.','source_text'=>'Aku akan memuat naik cerita bayangan aku di saluran kedua aku, Volka.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>842.12,'end_time'=>845.46,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve also started posting these videos as podcasts.','source_text'=>'Dan aku juga telah mula memuat naik video-video ini sebagai podcast.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>845.56,'end_time'=>848.82,'target_text'=>'Do you understand English but feel nervous when you speak?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda memahami Bahasa Inggeris tetapi berasa gugup apabila bercakap?','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>848.92,'end_time'=>856.78,'target_text'=>'Join my Patreon for my speaking, pronunciation, and shadowing course with over 90 video lessons.','source_text'=>'Sertai Patreon saya untuk kursus bertuturan, sebutan, dan bayangan saya dengan lebih daripada 90 pelajaran video.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>856.88,'end_time'=>864.3,'target_text'=>'You\'ll practice pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking with step-by-step video lessons.','source_text'=>'Anda akan berlatih sebutan, loghat, rentak, dan pertuturan semula jadi dengan pelajaran video langkah demi langkah.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>864.4,'end_time'=>866.78,'target_text'=>'Plus, new lessons every week.','source_text'=>'Ditambah pula dengan pelajaran baru setiap minggu.','order'=>321],
